      "itemId": "returning-faulty-headphones",
      "src": "/audio/stories/returning-faulty-headphones.mp3",
      "text": "Noah brings a pair of faulty headphones and his receipt to the store. “The sound cuts out on the left side,” he explains to the assistant. “Could you clarify when it happens?” she asks before testing them. Noah replies, “It happens even when the battery is full.” The assistant finds the same problem and offers a replacement. “Would a refund be possible?” Noah asks, because he has already bought another pair. “I need approval from my manager,” she says, “so I cannot promise a refund yet.” “Just to confirm, you will check with your manager before I decide,” Noah says.",
